          "explanation": "Rearrange to cos C = (a² + b² − c²)/(2ab).",
          "terms": [
            "math-ai-3.1-cosine-rule"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "math-ai-3.1-2-q05",
          "type": "mcq",
          "prompt": "From 15 m away on level ground, the angle of elevation of a treetop is 32°. Find the tree’s height.",
