            "7.95 m",
            "9.37 m",
            "24.0 m",
            "12.7 m"
          ],
          "answer": 1,
          "explanation": "h = 15 tan 32° ≈ 9.37 m.",
          "terms": [
            "math-ai-3.1-angle-of-elevation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "math-ai-3.1-2-q06",
          "type": "tf",
          "statement": "A bearing of 120° is measured anticlockwise from north.",
