          "explanation": "They are alternate angles between parallel horizontal lines.",
          "terms": [
            "math-ai-3.1-angle-of-depression",
            "math-ai-3.1-angle-of-elevation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "math-ai-3.1-2-q10",
          "type": "order",
          "prompt": "Put the steps for finding an angle from three sides in order.",
